      "reason_code": "",
      "review_status": "passed",
      "review_notes": [],
      "call_ids": [
        "ae6afbc3-8c2b-4962-a93b-19a6374f4ada",
        "1a4ed73c-b0c0-4642-bff5-ebe3a7f46634"
      ],
      "call_count": 2,
      "citation_check": "passed",
      "cited_source_count": 1,
      "status": "answered",
      "answer": "不是。专业版首次响应为两小时，但首次响应仅代表开始受理，不代表问题已解决。 [来源1]\n\n解决时间取决于故障原因，原文不承诺统一解决时限。 [来源1]",
